{"parse": {"title": "砂金甲虫", "pageid": 8617, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"砂金甲虫\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/eb/Item-111012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"砂金甲虫\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>砂金甲虫</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#111012</div></div><hr /><div>甲虫的躯壳成为了一具精致的吊坠。用于角色的洞悉与共鸣仪式，亦可作为合成高阶材料的素材。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">借由土壤的湿度、光照的变化，它们辨别着方位，期盼着自己成虫时刻的到来。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">来源</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-stage\"></td><td class=\"source-text\">仓库·<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/481007\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\" title=\"高阶秘物匣子\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E9%98%B6%E7%A7%98%E7%89%A9%E5%8C%A3%E5%AD%90\